  "ruleText": "Geo 302.05 Additional References. The board shall require of the applicant the names and addresses of additional references if the original information provided by the references is unclear, incomplete or contradictory.\n\nSource. #7526, eff 7-1-01; ss by #9439, eff 3-25-09; ss by #12152, eff 3-24-17",
